 side so I'll keep you posted.", "channel": "D07E9PSQB6W", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0021_SLACK_ID", "reactions": [{"count": 1, "name": "+1", "users": ["EMPLOYEE_0026_SLACK_ID"]}], "channel_info": {"id": "D07E9PSQB6W", "name": null, "is_private": false, "is_im": true, "is_mpim": false}, "user_profile": {"id": "EMPLOYEE_0021_SLACK_ID", "name": "Owen Baker", "real_name": "Owen Baker", "display_name": "Owen Baker", "email": "owen.baker@harmonygames.co"}, "time": "2025-12-04T22:17:13Z", "permalink": "https://harmonygamesgroup.slack.com/archives/D07E9PSQB6W/p1764886633228919", "participants": [{"id": "EMPLOYEE_0021_SLACK_ID", "name": "Owen Baker", "real_name": "Owen Baker", "display_name": "Owen Baker", "email": "owen.baker@harmonygames.co"}, {"id": "EMPLOYEE_0026_SLACK_ID", "name": "Brian Foster", "real_name": "Brian Foster", "display_name": "Brian Foster", "email": "brian.foster@harmonygames.co"}, {"id": "U05SER5GBFC", "name": "U05SER5GBFC", "real_name": "U05SER5GBFC", "display_name": "U05SER5GBFC", "email": null}, {"id": "U076SL1V4BV", "name": "U076SL1V4BV", "real_name": "U076SL1V4BV", "display_name": "U076SL1V4BV", "email": null}]}, {"ts": "1764659626.614679", "type": "message", "text": "Hello. I wanted to give a quick update of where we are. We are QAing changes that we had to make due to moving the game to Unity 6. Things are looking good and we expect to wrap those up in the next day or so. <@EMPLOYEE_0025_SLACK_ID> is working on SDK implementation and told me that the SDK is causing some issues regarding Singular, our default attribution provider vs appsflyer. He may have some questions for the team tomorrow. 

